# v0.4.0 — Iso-tower-parametric arc (foundation)

This release ships the **foundation** for use-site-driven
iso-tower-parametric data.  Every piece of plumbing is in place,
existing semantics are preserved end-to-end via 'tyKindMeta's
default-to-'*0' fall-through, and the rails are laid for the
v0.5.0+ carrier-specific overrides that turn the story on.

